rs  even more than love and steven  spielberg's adaptation of west side  story in the best comedy or musical  category  without a broadcaster for its awards  ceremony it's unclear how influential  these choices will be  on the all-important oscar awards that  follow in march  and whether the golden globes itself  will survive  rob reynolds al jazeera hollywood
 

